# Knob acceleration: slow turns are exact, quick ones sweep. 909 BD Tune (0..127) starts at 34.
wait 300
expect sound0.0.0 34
# slow, 80 ms a detent: one step each
turn K1 5 80
expect sound0.0.0 39
# quick, 10 ms a detent: 8 each (the first of a burst is timed from the last turn: one), so ten
# detents nearly sweep the range
turn K1 10 10
expect sound0.0.0 112
# medium, 30 ms a detent: 3 each
wait 500
turn K1 -3 30
expect sound0.0.0 105
# a quick full sweep down, then fine steps back up
wait 500
turn K1 -16 10
expect sound0.0.0 0
wait 500
turn K1 2 100
expect sound0.0.0 2
# tempo (wide range): slow is 1 BPM a detent, quick is 16
press HOME
turn SELECT 3 100
expect tempo 128
turn SELECT 4 10
release HOME
expect tempo 177
